======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 153 - Design a 1-to-1 Real-Time Chat System
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   HTTP short polling querying database every 2 seconds for new messages.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   WebSocket gateway servers + Redis Pub/Sub routing + Cassandra message history store.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
